---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <main class="night-sky-page">
    <section class="night-hero">
      <nav class="night-crumb mono" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>night-sky</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="night-hero__grid">
        <div class="night-hero__copy">
          <p class="night-kicker mono">El Segundo porch sky · 33.9192&deg;N 118.4165&deg;W</p>
          <h1>Night sky.</h1>
          <p class="night-dek">A fixed-star map for right now over El Segundo. The stars are real catalog positions, the rotation is live sidereal time, and the constellations are drawn as approximate porch-view stick figures.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="night-readout" aria-label="Current sky readout">
          <div><span class="readout-label mono">local time</span><strong id="sky-time">calculating</strong></div>
          <div><span class="readout-label mono">sidereal</span><strong id="sidereal-time">--:--</strong></div>
          <div><span class="readout-label mono">stars above</span><strong id="visible-stars">--</strong></div>
          <div><span class="readout-label mono">sky mode</span><strong id="sky-mode">checking</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sky-layout" aria-label="Current star map and notes">
      <div class="sky-panel">
        <div class="sky-panel__top">
          <div><p class="panel-kicker mono">Stereographic dome</p><h2>Above the porch, minute by minute.</h2></div>
          <span class="live-pill mono" id="live-pill">live geometry</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sky-shell">
          <svg id="sky-map" viewBox="0 0 600 600" role="img" aria-labelledby="sky-title sky-desc">
            <title id="sky-title">Current star map over El Segundo</title>
            <desc id="sky-desc">A stylized stereographic projection of bright stars and major constellation outlines above the horizon.</desc>
            <defs>
              <radialGradient id="sky-bg" cx="50%" cy="42%" r="62%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#18395c" /><stop offset="56%" stop-color="#0c2340" /><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#061324" /></radialGradient>
              <linearGradient id="horizon-glow" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#c47a42" stop-opacity="0" /><stop offset="60%" stop-color="#c47a42" stop-opacity="0.2" /><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f0b36b" stop-opacity="0.44" /></linearGradient>
              <filter id="soft-star" x="-60%" y="-60%" width="220%" height="220%"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="0.9" result="blur" /><feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur" /><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic" /></feMerge></filter>
              <clipPath id="dome-clip"><circle cx="300" cy="300" r="230" /></clipPath>
            </defs>
            <circle class="dome-fill" cx="300" cy="300" r="230" />
            <g clip-path="url(#dome-clip)">
              <rect class="horizon-wash" x="70" y="360" width="460" height="170" />
              <circle class="alt-ring" cx="300" cy="300" r="132.8" />
              <circle class="alt-ring alt-ring--inner" cx="300" cy="300" r="61.6" />
              <line class="az-line" x1="300" y1="70" x2="300" y2="530" />
              <line class="az-line" x1="70" y1="300" x2="530" y2="300" />
              <g id="constellation-lines"></g>
              <g id="star-layer"></g>
              <g id="label-layer"></g>
            </g>
            <circle class="horizon-ring" cx="300" cy="300" r="230" />
            <text class="cardinal cardinal--north" x="300" y="48">N</text>
            <text class="cardinal cardinal--east" x="558" y="306">E</text>
            <text class="cardinal cardinal--south" x="300" y="574">S</text>
            <text class="cardinal cardinal--west" x="42" y="306">W</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="sky-fineprint">Approximate J2000 star positions, no external APIs, no live planet claims. Daylight and cloud cover are noted but not removed from the geometric sky.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="sky-rail">
        <section class="notable-box" aria-labelledby="notable-title">
          <p class="panel-kicker mono">Tonight's notable</p>
          <h2 id="notable-title">Seasonal, not ephemeris.</h2>
          <p id="notable-copy">Choosing a deterministic year-cycle note.</p>
          <p class="notable-meta mono" id="notable-meta">No live planet positions used.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="pollution-box" aria-labelledby="pollution-title">
          <p class="panel-kicker mono">Porch limit</p>
          <h2 id="pollution-title">Bortle 7-8.</h2>
          <p>El Segundo is bright. You will still get Sirius, the Big Dipper, Orion, Vega, Capella, Arcturus, and the cleanest constellation bones. You will get less than the desert, and that is part of the page's honesty.</p>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="constellation-panel" aria-labelledby="constellation-title">
      <div class="constellation-panel__head">
        <p class="panel-kicker mono">Visible-now badges</p>
        <h2 id="constellation-title">Ten porch constellations.</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="constellation-list">
        {constellationCatalog.map((item) => (
          <li class="constellation-row" data-constellation-row={item.id}>
            <div><strong>{item.name}</strong><span>{item.short}</span></div>
            <span class="constellation-count mono" data-constellation-count={item.id}>-- stars</span>
            <span class="constellation-status mono" data-constellation-badge={item.id}>calculating</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <nav class="night-exits mono" aria-label="Night sky exits">
      <a href="/">front door</a>
      <a href="/window">window</a>
      <a href="/almanac">almanac</a>
      <a href="/wire">wire</a>
    </nav>
  </main>

  <script type="application/json" id="night-sky-data" set:html={JSON.stringify(data)}></script>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      'use strict';
      var LAT = 33.9192, LON = -118.4165, TZ = 'America/Los_Angeles';
      var SKY_CX = 300, SKY_CY = 300, SKY_R = 230, MS_PER_DAY = 86400000;
      var payloadEl = document.getElementById('night-sky-data');
      var payload = payloadEl ? JSON.parse(payloadEl.textContent || '{}') : {};
      var STARS = payload.stars || [], CONSTELLATIONS = payload.constellations || [], FACTS = payload.facts || [];
      var sky = document.getElementById('sky-map');
      var lineLayer = document.getElementById('constellation-lines');
      var starLayer = document.getElementById('star-layer');
      var labelLayer = document.getElementById('label-layer');
      var timeEl = document.getElementById('sky-time');
      var siderealEl = document.getElementById('sidereal-time');
      var visibleEl = document.getElementById('visible-stars');
      var modeEl = document.getElementById('sky-mode');
      var livePill = document.getElementById('live-pill');
      var notableCopy = document.getElementById('notable-copy');
      var notableMeta = document.getElementById('notable-meta');
      if (!sky || !lineLayer || !starLayer || !labelLayer) return;

      function rad(deg) { return deg * Math.PI / 180; }
      function deg(radians) { return radians * 180 / Math.PI; }
      function normalizeDegrees(v) { var n = v % 360; return n < 0 ? n + 360 : n; }
      function normalizeHours(v) { var n = v % 24; return n < 0 ? n + 24 : n; }
      function julianDay(date) { return date.getTime() / MS_PER_DAY + 2440587.5; }
      function localSiderealHours(date) {
        var d = julianDay(date) - 2451545.0;
        var gmst = normalizeHours(18.697374558 + 24.06570982441908 * d);
        return normalizeHours(gmst + LON / 15);
      }
      function altAzFromRaDec(raHours, decDeg, date) {
        var lst = localSiderealHours(date);
        var haDeg = normalizeDegrees((lst - raHours) * 15);
        if (haDeg > 180) haDeg -= 360;
        var ha = rad(haDeg), dec = rad(decDeg), lat = rad(LAT);
        var sinAlt = Math.sin(dec) * Math.sin(lat) + Math.cos(dec) * Math.cos(lat) * Math.cos(ha);
        var alt = Math.asin(Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, sinAlt)));
        var az = Math.atan2(Math.sin(ha), Math.cos(ha) * Math.sin(lat) - Math.tan(dec) * Math.cos(lat));
        return { alt: deg(alt), az: normalizeDegrees(deg(az) + 180) };
      }
      function project(altDeg, azDeg) {
        if (altDeg <= 0) return null;
        var zenithDistance = rad(90 - altDeg);
        var rho = SKY_R * Math.tan(zenithDistance / 2);
        var az = rad(azDeg);
        return { x: SKY_CX + rho * Math.sin(az), y: SKY_CY - rho * Math.cos(az), r: rho };
      }
      function svgEl(name, attrs) {
        var el = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', name);
        Object.keys(attrs || {}).forEach(function (key) { el.setAttribute(key, attrs[key]); });
        return el;
      }
      function clear(el) { while (el.firstChild) el.removeChild(el.firstChild); }
      function starSize(mag) { return Math.max(1.15, Math.min(7.4, 4.9 - mag * 0.92)); }
      function starClass(star) { var tint = star.tint ? ' star-dot--' + star.tint : ''; return 'star-dot' + tint; }
      function localDateParts(date) {
        var parts = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', { timeZone: TZ, year: 'numeric', month: '2-digit', day: '2-digit', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', hourCycle: 'h23' }).formatToParts(date);
        var out = {};
        for (var i = 0; i < parts.length; i += 1) out[parts[i].type] = parts[i].value;
        return { year: Number(out.year), month: Number(out.month), day: Number(out.day), hour: Number(out.hour), minute: Number(out.minute), key: out.year + '-' + out.month + '-' + out.day };
      }
      function hashString(input) {
        var hash = 2166136261;
        for (var i = 0; i < input.length; i += 1) { hash ^= input.charCodeAt(i); hash = Math.imul(hash, 16777619); }
        return hash >>> 0;
      }
      function inDateRange(parts, range) {
        if (!range) return false;
        var value = parts.month * 100 + parts.day;
        var start = range[0] * 100 + range[1], end = range[2] * 100 + range[3];
        if (start <= end) return value >= start && value <= end;
        return value >= start || value <= end;
      }
      function chooseNotable(now) {
        var parts = localDateParts(now);
        var active = FACTS.filter(function (fact) { return inDateRange(parts, fact.range) || (fact.months && fact.months.indexOf(parts.month) !== -1); });
        if (!active.length) active = FACTS;
        var picked = active[hashString(parts.key) % active.length];
        return { fact: picked, key: parts.key };
      }
      function solarRaDec(date) {
        var jd = julianDay(date), n = jd - 2451545.0;
        var meanLong = normalizeDegrees(280.46 + 0.9856474 * n);
        var meanAnomaly = normalizeDegrees(357.528 + 0.9856003 * n);
        var lambda = normalizeDegrees(meanLong + 1.915 * Math.sin(rad(meanAnomaly)) + 0.02 * Math.sin(rad(2 * meanAnomaly)));
        var epsilon = 23.439 - 0.0000004 * n;
        var y = Math.cos(rad(epsilon)) * Math.sin(rad(lambda));
        var x = Math.cos(rad(lambda));
        var ra = normalizeDegrees(deg(Math.atan2(y, x))) / 15;
        var dec = deg(Math.asin(Math.sin(rad(epsilon)) * Math.sin(rad(lambda))));
        return { ra: ra, dec: dec };
      }
      function sunAltitude(date) { var sun = solarRaDec(date); return altAzFromRaDec(sun.ra, sun.dec, date).alt; }
      function formatLocalTime(date) {
        try { return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', { timeZone: TZ, weekday: 'short', month: 'short', day: 'numeric', hour: 'numeric', minute: '2-digit' }).format(date); }
        catch (e) { return date.toLocaleString(); }
      }
      function formatSidereal(hours) {
        var h = Math.floor(hours), m = Math.floor((hours - h) * 60);
        return String(h).padStart(2, '0') + ':' + String(m).padStart(2, '0');
      }
      function constellationStarIds(con) {
        var ids = [];
        con.lines.forEach(function (line) { if (ids.indexOf(line[0]) === -1) ids.push(line[0]); if (ids.indexOf(line[1]) === -1) ids.push(line[1]); });
        return ids;
      }
      function renderConstellationStatus(con, positions, altitudes) {
        var ids = constellationStarIds(con);
        var above = ids.filter(function (id) { return altitudes[id] > 0; });
        var row = document.querySelector('[data-constellation-row="' + con.id + '"]');
        var badge = document.querySelector('[data-constellation-badge="' + con.id + '"]');
        var count = document.querySelector('[data-constellation-count="' + con.id + '"]');
        if (badge) {
          badge.textContent = above.length ? 'above horizon' : 'below the porch';
          badge.classList.toggle('is-up', above.length > 0);
          badge.classList.toggle('is-down', above.length === 0);
        }
        if (count) count.textContent = above.length + '/' + ids.length + ' stars';
        if (row) row.classList.toggle('is-up', above.length > 0);
        var visiblePoints = above.map(function (id) { return positions[id]; }).filter(Boolean);
        if (visiblePoints.length >= 2) {
          var x = 0, y = 0;
          visiblePoints.forEach(function (pt) { x += pt.x; y += pt.y; });
          var label = svgEl('text', { class: 'constellation-label', x: String(x / visiblePoints.length), y: String(y / visiblePoints.length) });
          label.textContent = con.name;
          labelLayer.appendChild(label);
        }
      }
      function render() {
        var now = new Date();
        var lst = localSiderealHours(now);
        var positions = {}, altitudes = {}, visibleCount = 0;
        clear(lineLayer); clear(starLayer); clear(labelLayer);
        STARS.forEach(function (star) {
          var aa = altAzFromRaDec(star.ra, star.dec, now);
          altitudes[star.id] = aa.alt;
          var point = project(aa.alt, aa.az);
          if (!point) return;
          visibleCount += 1;
          positions[star.id] = point;
        });
        CONSTELLATIONS.forEach(function (con) {
          con.lines.forEach(function (line) {
            var a = positions[line[0]], b = positions[line[1]];
            if (!a || !b) return;
            lineLayer.appendChild(svgEl('line', { class: 'constellation-line', x1: a.x.toFixed(2), y1: a.y.toFixed(2), x2: b.x.toFixed(2), y2: b.y.toFixed(2) }));
          });
        });
        STARS.forEach(function (star) {
          var point = positions[star.id];
          if (!point) return;
          var circle = svgEl('circle', { class: starClass(star), cx: point.x.toFixed(2), cy: point.y.toFixed(2), r: starSize(star.mag).toFixed(2), opacity: String(Math.min(1, 0.58 + Math.max(0, altitudes[star.id]) / 120)) });
          var title = svgEl('title', {});
          title.textContent = star.name + ' - ' + star.con + ' - mag ' + star.mag;
          circle.appendChild(title);
          starLayer.appendChild(circle);
          if (star.mag <= 1.65 || star.id === 'polaris') {
            var label = svgEl('text', { class: 'star-label', x: (point.x + 8).toFixed(2), y: (point.y - 7).toFixed(2) });
            label.textContent = star.name;
            labelLayer.appendChild(label);
          }
        });
        CONSTELLATIONS.forEach(function (con) { renderConstellationStatus(con, positions, altitudes); });
        var sunAlt = sunAltitude(now);
        var mode = sunAlt < -6 ? 'after dark' : (sunAlt < 0 ? 'twilight geometry' : 'daylight preview');
        var notable = chooseNotable(now);
        if (timeEl) timeEl.textContent = formatLocalTime(now);
        if (siderealEl) siderealEl.textContent = formatSidereal(lst);
        if (visibleEl) visibleEl.textContent = String(visibleCount);
        if (modeEl) modeEl.textContent = mode;
        if (livePill) livePill.textContent = mode;
        if (notableCopy && notable.fact) notableCopy.textContent = notable.fact.text;
        if (notableMeta) notableMeta.textContent = notable.key + ' - deterministic seasonal note, not a live planet ephemeris.';
      }
      render();
      var timer = window.setInterval(render, 60000);
      document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', function () { window.clearInterval(timer); }, { once: true });
    })();
  </script>

  <style is:global>
    body:has(.night-sky-page) { background: #061224; color: #f8f0df; }
    .night-sky-page { min-height: 100vh; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(70, 108, 150, 0.32), transparent 36rem), linear-gradient(180deg, #061224 0%, #0a1628 62%, #2a1c18 100%); color: #f8f0df; padding: 34px 18px 86px; }
    .night-sky-page * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace); }
    .night-hero, .sky-layout, .constellation-panel, .night-exits { width: min(1120px, 100%); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .night-crumb { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 28px; color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.64); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .night-crumb a, .night-exits a { color: #f2b46f; text-decoration: none; }
    .night-crumb a:hover, .night-exits a:hover { color: #ffe1ad; }
    .night-hero__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(260px, 380px); gap: 22px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .night-kicker, .panel-kicker, .readout-label { margin: 0; color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.62); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .night-hero h1 { margin: 8px 0 10px; max-width: 9ch; font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(48px, 11vw, 116px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 0.9; color: #fff7e9; }
    .night-dek { max-width: 64ch; margin: 0; color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.78); font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px); line-height: 1.58; }
    .night-readout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.18); background: rgba(4, 12, 25, 0.48); box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
    .night-readout div { min-height: 72px; padding: 11px 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.12); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035); }
    .night-readout strong { display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: #fff9ed; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.15; }
    .sky-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.58fr) minmax(260px, 0.82fr); gap: 18px; align-items: stretch; }
    .sky-panel, .notable-box, .pollution-box, .constellation-panel { border: 1px solid rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.16); background: rgba(3, 10, 22, 0.52); box-shadow: 0 22px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28); }
    .sky-panel { padding: 16px; }
    .sky-panel__top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .sky-panel h2, .notable-box h2, .pollution-box h2, .constellation-panel h2 { margin: 5px 0 0; color: #fff7e9; font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 3.3vw, 40px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.05; }
    .live-pill { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(242, 180, 111, 0.42); background: rgba(242, 180, 111, 0.1); color: #ffd19b; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .sky-shell { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.12); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035), transparent), #06101f; }
    .sky-shell::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 8%; right: 8%; bottom: 0; height: 24%; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center bottom, rgba(245, 174, 96, 0.36), transparent 70%); filter: blur(8px); }
    #sky-map { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; min-height: 320px; }
    .dome-fill { fill: url(#sky-bg); }
    .horizon-wash { fill: url(#horizon-glow); }
    .horizon-ring { fill: none; stroke: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.58); stroke-width: 1.4; }
    .alt-ring, .az-line { fill: none; stroke: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.09); stroke-width: 1; }
    .alt-ring--inner { stroke: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.12); }
    .constellation-line { stroke: rgba(255, 224, 177, 0.42); stroke-width: 1.15; stroke-linecap: round; }
    .star-dot { fill: #fff9ec; filter: url(#soft-star); }
    .star-dot--warm { fill: #ffc88f; }
    .star-dot--blue { fill: #dbeaff; }
    .star-dot--gold { fill: #ffe2a8; }
    .star-label, .constellation-label, .cardinal { font-family: var(--font-mono, 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; paint-order: stroke; stroke: rgba(6, 19, 36, 0.86); stroke-width: 3px; stroke-linejoin: round; }
    .star-label { fill: rgba(255, 249, 236, 0.8); }
    .constellation-label { fill: rgba(242, 180, 111, 0.7); text-anchor: middle; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .cardinal { fill: rgba(255, 225, 173, 0.9); text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: middle; font-size: 13px; stroke-width: 4px; }
    .sky-fineprint { margin: 11px 2px 0; color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.58); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .sky-rail { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
    .notable-box, .pollution-box { padding: 18px; }
    .notable-box p, .pollution-box p { color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.77); line-height: 1.55; font-size: 14px; }
    .notable-box #notable-copy { margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: 17px; color: #fff3db; }
    .notable-meta { margin: 14px 0 0; color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.48); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .constellation-panel { margin-top: 18px; padding: 18px; }
    .constellation-panel__head { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .constellation-list { list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 9px; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .constellation-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto auto; gap: 10px; align-items: center; min-height: 66px; padding: 11px 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.12); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035); }
    .constellation-row.is-up { border-color: rgba(242, 180, 111, 0.34); background: rgba(242, 180, 111, 0.075); }
    .constellation-row strong { display: block; color: #fff9ec; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.2; }
    .constellation-row div span { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.56); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.25; }
    .constellation-count { color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.5); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
    .constellation-status { padding: 7px 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.16); color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.64); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.11em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
    .constellation-status.is-up { border-color: rgba(242, 180, 111, 0.48); background: rgba(242, 180, 111, 0.12); color: #ffd19b; }
    .constellation-status.is-down { color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.42); }
    .night-exits { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 22px; color: rgba(248, 240, 223, 0.54); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .night-exits a { padding: 8px 0; }
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .night-hero__grid, .sky-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .night-readout { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .constellation-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .night-sky-page { padding: 24px 12px 70px; }
      .night-hero h1 { max-width: none; }
      .night-readout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .sky-panel, .notable-box, .pollution-box, .constellation-panel { padding: 12px; }
      .sky-panel__top { flex-direction: column; }
      .star-label { display: none; }
      .constellation-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }
      .constellation-count, .constellation-status { width: fit-content; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
